{
 "_about": "Shared by s3Dgraphy (tests/test_container_layouts.py) and EMStudio (frontend/scripts/check-container.mjs, testdata/container-layout-parity.json is a byte copy). The rule: graphs.<id>.layout when a member has one; else the file-level layout for ONE graph and nobody else: the graph whose nodes it positions (most positions wins), else — tie, no positions — the ACTIVE graph (or the only one); the rest are laid out afresh and listed in `fresh` only for an OLD file (a file-level layout and no member carrying its own). On write, each member carries its own and the file-level layout is a copy of the active graph's.",
